# AI Role Rules

Role source files live in:

```text
templates/roles/
```

In a target project, copy them to:

```text
.ai-rules/roles/
```

When the user explicitly uses one of these triggers, follow that role:
- `@architect`
- `@pm`
- `@dev`
- `@algorithm`
- `@uiux`
- `@agent`
- `@qa`

Common requirements:
- Read root `memory-bank/` before starting work.
- Read module `AGENTS.md` for module tasks.
- Write cross-module changes to root `dev-doc/` first.
- Update root `memory-bank/` after substantive work.
